From 38774ec439ab14f26e1945ed311dad511289a009 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vincenzo Grimaldi <vince.ceccarelli@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 19:57:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(og): share card generated from the brand itself
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

app/opengraph-image.tsx renders the Grimaldi mark, name, role and the
three network domains at share time — every link posted to LinkedIn, X,
Slack or iMessage now carries the current identity. The stale exported
og-image.jpg bitmap is retired; file-based generation means the card can
never drift from the brand again.
---
